## 2. The {{SIGNATURE_PRIMITIVE}} system

The {{SIGNATURE_PRIMITIVE}} is not a decoration — it is a **semantic primitive**
that appears across the whole product. Rule: **{{PALETTE_ACCENT}} = {{SIGNATURE_PRIMITIVE_MEANING}}**.
It is the only saturated color in the entire brand. When a user sees it,
it means something consistent, everywhere.

