## 5. Logo system

### The mark

{{MARK_ONE_LINER}} (see §1 for the deep reading)

### Variants

Canonical assets live at `public/brand/` and are referenced as `/brand/<file>`.
SVG is primary; PNG is fallback.

| Variant | SVG | PNG | Use |
|---|---|---|---|
| Icon (light) | `/brand/logo-icon.svg` | `/brand/logo-icon.png` | Default. Works on any background. |
| Icon (dark) | `/brand/logo-icon-dark.svg` | `/brand/logo-icon-dark.png` | Dark surfaces only. |
| Wordmark (light) | `/brand/logo-wordmark.svg` | `/brand/logo-wordmark.png` | Default wordmark on light surfaces. |
| Wordmark (dark) | `/brand/logo-wordmark-dark.svg` | `/brand/logo-wordmark-dark.png` | Dark surfaces only. |

### Favicon + PWA pack

Generate via the [brand-assets](https://github.com/shaharsha/claude-skills/tree/main/skills/brand-assets)
skill's `icon-pack.sh`. This section specs the **requirements**:

| File | Size | Bg | Dark-aware | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `favicon.svg` | vector | transparent | **yes** — via embedded `<style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)` swapping fg fills; accent stays constant | Modern browsers (Chrome 111+, Firefox, Safari) |
| `favicon-32x32.png` | 32×32 | transparent | no | PNG fallback for browsers that don't render SVG favicons |
| `apple-touch-icon.png` | 180×180 | **opaque** {{PALETTE_BG}} | no | iOS auto-rounds corners; refuses transparency |
| `icon-192.png` | 192×192 | transparent | no | PWA home-screen |
| `icon-512.png` | 512×512 | transparent | no | PWA splash + large surfaces |
| `icon-192-maskable.png` | 192×192 | opaque, 20% safe-area padding | no | Android may mask to any shape |
| `icon-512-maskable.png` | 512×512 | opaque, 20% safe-area padding | no | Same, larger |
| `og-image.png` (light) | 1200×630 | opaque {{PALETTE_BG}} | — | Social card for light-mode platforms |
| `og-image-dark.png` | 1200×630 | opaque {{PALETTE_FG}} | — | Social card for dark-mode platforms and Discord |
| `manifest.json` | — | — | — | Lists the above; `theme_color: {{PALETTE_BG}}`, `background_color: {{PALETTE_BG}}` |

### The system-aware SVG favicon (2026 move)

```xml
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64">
  <style>
    .fg     { fill: {{PALETTE_FG}}; }     /* dark on light systems */
    .accent { fill: {{PALETTE_ACCENT}}; } /* theme-constant */
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      .fg   { fill: {{PALETTE_BG}}; }     /* swap to light on dark systems */
    }
  </style>
  <!-- mark geometry here -->
</svg>
```

### Theme-color meta tags

```html
<meta name="theme-color" content="{{PALETTE_BG}}" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
<meta name="theme-color" content="{{PALETTE_FG}}" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
```

Without both, the browser chrome clashes in one of the two system
themes.

### Construction rules

- **Clear space**: ≥ 1× the height of the mark on every side.
- **Minimum size**: icon 24px, wordmark 120px wide.
- **Colour lockdown**: accent is always `{{PALETTE_ACCENT}}`. Never recolour.
- **Background**: `{{PALETTE_BG}}` or `{{PALETTE_FG}}`. White allowed with restraint.

### Don'ts

- Don't outline the mark. It's filled.
- Don't rotate, skew, emboss, or shadow.
- Don't swap the accent for a gradient or emoji.
- Don't animate the mark in UI chrome — only in hero moments on first paint.

