## 7. Typography

### Face

**Primary**: **{{PRIMARY_FONT}}** for {{SCRIPT_SUPPORT}}.

{{TYPEFACE_RATIONALE}}

```html
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family={{PRIMARY_FONT_URL}}&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

### Tabular numerals

```css
.tabular { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
```

Prices and stats align cleanly in columns.

### Font smoothing

```css
body { -webkit-font-smoothing: auto; }
```

**Never** `antialiased` — it renders heavier scripts (Hebrew, Arabic,
Devanagari) unreadably thin on low-DPI Android.

### The scale

| Token | Size | LH | Weight | Use |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `--text-mega` | `clamp(3rem, 12vw, 12rem)` | 0.95 | 700 | Hero moments — once per page max |
| `--text-display` | `clamp(2.5rem, 5vw + 1rem, 4.5rem)` | 1.05 | 700 | Section heros |
| `--text-h1` | `clamp(2rem, 3vw + 1rem, 3rem)` | 1.1 | 700 | Page titles |
| `--text-h2` | `clamp(1.5rem, 2vw + 0.75rem, 2.25rem)` | 1.15 | 600 | Section titles |
| `--text-h3` | `clamp(1.25rem, 1vw + 1rem, 1.5rem)` | 1.2 | 600 | Card titles |
| `--text-lead` | `clamp(1.125rem, 0.5vw + 1rem, 1.375rem)` | 1.55 | 400 | Lead paragraphs |
| `--text-body` | `1rem` | 1.75 | 400 | Default body |
| `--text-body-sm` | `0.875rem` | 1.55 | 400 | Secondary body, captions |
| `--text-ui` | `0.9375rem` | 1.4 | 500 | Buttons, nav, labels |
| `--text-micro` | `0.75rem` | 1.3 | 500 | Meta, timestamps, legal |

