## 8. Iconography

### Style

Single-weight line icons, 1.75px stroke at 24×24. Rounded caps, rounded
joins. Prefer Lucide (`lucide-react`) or a library with consistent
construction.

### Colour rules

- Default icon color = `--text`. Inherits from surrounding text.
- On CTAs: `currentColor` (never hard-coded white).
- **Never tint icons {{PALETTE_ACCENT}}** — the accent is reserved for the
  {{SIGNATURE_PRIMITIVE}} system. Icons stay monochrome.

### Size tokens

| Token | Size | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `--icon-xs` | 14px | Inline with small text |
| `--icon-sm` | 16px | Inline with body |
| `--icon-md` | 20px | Default UI |
| `--icon-lg` | 24px | Section headers |
| `--icon-xl` | 32px | Empty states |

### RTL flipping

Directional icons (arrows, chevrons, send/reply) flip via
`.icon-flip { transform: scaleX(-1); }` in `[dir="rtl"]` scope.
Non-directional (search, user, check, clock) stay upright.

