## 18. Components

Opinionated copy-paste primitives. All CSS below assumes the `@theme`
block from §17 is loaded. Every component must document **four states**:
default, loading, empty, error.

### Buttons

Five variants × three sizes. Max **one** `.btn-primary` per screen-fold.

| Class | Use |
|---|---|
| `.btn-primary` | Accent fill, bg-coloured text. The "please click this" moment. |
| `.btn-secondary` | Text on transparent, neutral border. Peer to primary, recessive. |
| `.btn-ghost` | Text, no border until hover. Nav, toolbars, quiet actions. |
| `.btn-glass` | On photographs. Uses the glass material (§10). |
| `.btn-destructive` | Danger fill. Irreversible actions only. |

| Size | Height | Padding-X | Font | Icon |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `.btn-sm` | 36px | 14px | 0.875rem / 500 | 14px |
| `.btn-md` (default) | 44px | 20px | 0.9375rem / 500 | 16px |
| `.btn-lg` | 52px | 28px | 1rem / 600 | 18px |

**Loading state**: replace button contents with a pulsing
`{{SIGNATURE_PRIMITIVE}}`. Freeze width with `inline-size: <measured>;`
so layout doesn't jump.

### Inputs, Cards, Badges, Nav, Alerts, Dialogs, Menus, Prose

{{COMPONENT_DETAILS}}

### Landing primitives

**Hero** — one per landing. Uses `--text-mega` (once per page).
**Feature row** — 3 columns desktop, stack mobile. No cards — pure typography.
**Pricing tier** — one card per plan. The period in the price is the
  {{SIGNATURE_PRIMITIVE}}.
**FAQ accordion** — native `<details>`/`<summary>`, no JS.
**Footer** — minimal. No newsletter signup. No social icons unless used.

